                 ALIASES AND NICKNAMES
 
Aliases are one word custom commands you can make to make 
mudding easier for you.  You can alias a complicated, 
mutli-word command into one easy to remember command.
For example:
 
alias th tell hannah
 
Now when you type:
 
'th Hey, give me an unkill!'
 
It is the same as if you had typed:
 
'tell hannah Hey, give me an unkill!'
 
Nicknames are similar in that you can use them to simplify 
your mud life by making things easier to type.
 
Say a buddy of yours on the mud has chosen the name 'Xiasdlkd.'
You can type:
 
'nickname buddy xiasdlkd'
 
and now whenever you type 'buddy' the mud will recognize it as
'xiasdlkd.'
 
You can also type 'nickname' or 'alias' alone to see a list of 
your aliases or nicknames.  
